# matrices/lfm2-qwen35-s26-pregpu-current-lfm2-26b-android.cells and matrices/lfm2-qwen35-s26-pregpu-current-lfm2-26b-exp-android.cells:
# one launch per file of those files on their build (v0.19.0-pregpu), task long-context-1024-gen256 (its fixed long
# prompt, 1,746 prompt tokens on the LFM2 files and 1,359 on Qwen3.5 0.8B (the records' promptTokenCount of
# 2026-11-20); 256 tokens out, context 2048; the form of matrices/lfm2-qwen35-s26-textcheck-pregpu-composite-android.cells):
# the reply text of every file on this build (native-benchmark-1024x256 prints none; parsers.text_integrity + a
# person's read), and the launch that builds each copy's GPU caches. Right before each sitting, the rows of that
# sitting's files run, and no others. Not page rows: campaigns <date>-lfm2-qwen35-s26-textcheck-h3a-android (the five files
# of the first sitting), <date>-lfm2-qwen35-s26-textcheck-h3b-android (the two LFM2-2.6B files) and
# <date>-lfm2-qwen35-s26-textcheck-h3c-android (the two LFM2-2.6B-Exp files), no `dashboard`. Same model ids, files and build
# as the three page files; size, Hub revision and LFS sha256 on their comments.
# Run (from the repo root): BENCH_SITTING=1 BENCH_ANDROID_SERIAL=<serial> BENCH_CPU_MASK= COOLDOWN=30 CAMPAIGN=<campaign> python3 android/bench/run_campaign.py <a file of one sitting's rows of this file>
